                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> all transactions with acquirer response different that &quot;APPROVED&quot; and &quot;FRAUD&quot;.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Dropped transactions:</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> all 3DS transactions with acquirer response &quot;DECLINED&quot; and raw acquirer response null. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Success Rate (SR):</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> # successful transactions / # all transactions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Fraud Rate (FR):</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> # fraud transactions / # all transactions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Bank Refusal Rate (BR):</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> # bank refused transactions / # all transactions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Drop Rate (DR):</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> # dropped transactions / # all transactions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>User Success Rate:</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> # users with successful transactions / # all users</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>User Fraud Rate:</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> # users with fraud transactions / # all users</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>User Bank Refusal Rate:</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> # users with bank refused transactions / # all users</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>User Drop Rate:</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> # users with dropped transactions / # all users</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#050038' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='15'>About the self service tab</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>The self service tab is a dynamic way of understanding the data, where the person looking at the data may choose what they want to see in order to have a deeper understanding of the Success Rate. In the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Table Self Service</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>,  different dimensions and metrics can be chosen and compared over customizable time periods. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{0B9F10F2-5CC8-4BB2-90E5-29768B5DBAB7}' />
    </dashboard>
